  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Establishing Institutional Scores With the Rigor and Transparency Index: Large-scale Analysis of Scientific Reporting Quality (Preprint) (2022) in Unknown. 1 citation.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Establishing Institutional Scores With the Rigor and Transparency Index: Large-scale Analysis of Scientific Reporting Quality (Preprint) (2022) in Unknown is authored by Joseph Menke, Peter Eckmann and \u0130brahim Burak \u00d6zyurt. Topics: Transparency (behavior), Checklist, Rigour, Computer science and Library science.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">1 citations (OpenAlex). Citing venues include Research Integrity and Peer Review.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Limited online visibility beyond citations.</p>",
